# Local testing artifacts. The seed script, room catalog, eval harness
# and question set are workspace-specific (Genie space IDs, table paths,
# sample questions, gold routing decisions) and intentionally not
# published — anyone deploying this app configures gateways + routers via
# the UI or their own scripted wrapper.
scripts/seed_app.py
# router/ is a standalone reference POC — the integrated router lives
# under backend/app/api/router_routes.py.
router/
seed/
eval/
QUESTIONS.md

# Per-developer DAB overlay (auto-included via include: ['*.local.yml']).
# Used to override workspace-specific defaults like dev_user. The
# `.example` template IS committed; the actual overlay is not.
databricks.local.yml

# Internal research / audit notes referencing specific commits + deploy
# specifics. Keep local.
docs/lakebase_appkit_audit.md
docs/lakebase_appkit_audit.md.comments.json

# Auto-generated version file (written by install.sh at deploy time)
backend/app/_version.py
